PL/.NET v1.0.0 - https://github.com/Brick-Abode/pldotnet

Usage instructions:
- If you are running this through a `docker run` command overriding the default command, you need to simply start PostgreSQL with:
    `pg_ctlcluster 17 main start`
- To play around with PL/.NET, you can use `psql`:
    `runuser -u postgres psql`
- Then you can execute .NET code in your database:
    `do $$ Elog.Info("Hello, World!"); $$ language plcsharp;`
